# Architecture

## Projects

| Project | Role |
|---------|------|
| `SET.WebAPI` | Controllers, DTOs, helpers, Startup/Program, resources |
| `SET.BusinessLogic` | Services in feature folders under `Services/` (`Ai`, `Auth`, `Email`, `Push`, `Reminder`); interface sits next to its implementation; single `BusinessLogic` namespace |
| `SET.DAL` (`SET.DataAccess`) | `AppDbContext`, entity configs, EF migrations |
| `SET.Shared` | Entities, shared DTOs/extensions |
| `SET.UnitTests` | Unit tests |

Solution: `Mentor.SET.Backend.sln`.

## Data

- PostgreSQL via EF Core; schemas in `SET.DAL/Schemas.cs`: `app`, `goal`, `hbt`, `arlf`, `tsk`
- Entities: `SET.Shared/Models` · configs: `SET.DAL/EntityConfigurations` · register in `AppDbContext.OnModelCreating`
- Most PK sequences start at 100 (`nextval('schema.sq__…')`); tasks/subtasks may use identity — follow the nearest existing table
- Task ↔ subtasks: cascade delete; unique `(TaskId, ClientId)` where `ClientId` is the Flutter checklist row id

## Mapping

- Controllers use AutoMapper and/or dedicated helpers (e.g. `TaskDtoMapper`)
- Keep entity ↔ DTO mapping next to the feature; do not leak EF entities as API responses
